<BaseLayout title="Swap Kits" description="Available LS swap kits for the Hyundai Genesis Coupe.">
  <h1>Swap Kits</h1>
  <p>
    Complete kits that include motor mounts, oil pans, and headers make the swap much more straightforward.
  </p>

  <h2>Available Kits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Sikky</strong> — most popular. Complete kits with mounts, oil pan, and headers. <a href="https://www.sikky.com/product/hyundai-genesis-lsx-swap-kit/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sikky kit</a></li>
    <li><strong>LOJ Conversions</strong> — mounts with more adjustment for engine position. <a href="https://lojkits.com/collections/hyundai-genesis-coupe-bk-engine-swap-parts" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LOJ collection</a></li>
    <li><strong>ISR Performance</strong> — cheapest mounts. Headers sit lower and are not recommended on powered cars. <a href="https://www.isrperformance.com/isr-performance-hyundai-genesis-ls-mount-kit/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ISR mounts</a></li>
  </ul>

